  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Growing up on the mean streets of Yay Blvd, Zip learned early that survival in Subchain City meant being quick, resourceful, and maybe a little…infected. He witnessed the Great Drip Drought firsthand, his flock scattered to the winds. Now, armed with grit and a scavenged Cryo pack, he's determined to carve out his own destiny, one DRIP at a time.",
