    "name": "Zip 'Parasite' Quacker",
    "personality": "Cynical but driven. Zip has seen the worst of Subchain City, making him distrustful but also fiercely protective of those he deems worthy. He possesses a gallows humor, cracking jokes even in the face of danger, a coping mechanism honed from years of navigating the wasteland.",
